+````markdown name=ops/docs/LEVEL4_PROMOTION_CHECKS.md
+# Level‑4 Promotion Checks & Automation
+
+This document explains the automated readiness calculation and the guarded promotion to Level‑4 (remove routine gates).
+
+What the readiness_calculator does
+- Reads evidence from EVIDENCE_BUCKET (env var).
+- Runs or consumes validators: checkpoint_analyzer, otel_span_coverage_checker, opa_full_harness_runner, remediation_analyzer, security summary, explainability index, billing artifacts, and weekly SLO reports.
+- Computes a weighted readiness percentage and uploads a readiness report to:
+  - s3://<bucket>/production_proofs/readiness/readiness-<ts>.json
+- Default weighted components:
+  - HPO checkpoints: 20
+  - long-shadow + 2k: 20
+  - OTEL coverage: 10
+  - OPA mismatch: 10
+  - remediation reliability: 10
+  - security (pen-test): 15
+  - gatekeeper canary verification: 5
+  - billing/quota: 5
+  - explainability indexing/ACL: 3
+  - long-term SLO weeks: 2
+
+Promotion guard (promote_to_level4.sh)
+- Checks the latest readiness report and requires:
+  - readiness percentage >= provided minimum (default 85%)
+  - a legal signoff marker present in S3 (default key: compliance/legal_signoff.txt)
+- If checks pass, runs controlled_gatekeeper rollout and records a promotion marker to:
+  - s3://<bucket>/governance/level4_promote-<ts>.json
+
+Recommended operator flow
+1. Run full production proofs (Tekton / GH workflow) and wait for final summary & evidence to upload.
+2. Re-run validators as needed and ensure readiness_calculator reports >= 85.
+3. Obtain Legal signoff by uploading a short token to S3:
+   - echo "legal ok - $(date -u)" > /tmp/legal_ok.txt
+   - aws s3 cp /tmp/legal_ok.txt s3://<bucket>/compliance/legal_signoff.txt
+4. Run promotion:
+   - export EVIDENCE_BUCKET=s3://<bucket>
+   - ./ops/production/promote_to_level4.sh --min-readiness 85
+
+Notes & safety
+- Promotion script performs controlled Gatekeeper rollout and a webhook verification. It does NOT automatically run Terraform apply for infra changes — Terraform plan is still gated and requires APPLY=true to run.
+- Keep human-in-the-loop for the first few promotions; treat the promote script as an operator helper, not a fully autonomous switch.
+- All actions create/upload evidence to the evidence bucket for audit & postmortem.
+
